## This website

The content of this website is provided for general information about our services. We take care to keep it accurate, but it may change without notice.

## Certificate verification

A match in the certificate lookup confirms that a certificate number is on record in our registry with the details shown. Compare those details, and any photographs, with the coin and label in front of you. If they differ, or if a holder shows signs of tampering, contact us before buying or selling the coin.

Please use the lookup for individual enquiries. Automated or bulk querying is not permitted.

## Submissions

The terms that apply to a grading submission, including fees, turnaround and shipping, are set out in the quote we send you before you ship any coins.

## Content

The text, designs and illustrations on this website belong to Provident Numismatic Authentication and may not be reproduced without permission.

## Questions

For any question about these terms, [contact us](/contact).
